  <!--
    ==================== Configuration domains ====================
    Some fallbacks below are the official 24px "regular" outlines from
    microsoft/fluentui-system-icons, imported verbatim and stored locally so the application stays
    offline. Source: https://github.com/microsoft/fluentui-system-icons
    Licence: MIT, Copyright (c) 2020 Microsoft Corporation. See docs/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.

    Fluent paths rely on the non-zero winding rule, hence the F1 prefix where present: their
    counters are cut by reversed sub-paths, so rendering them even-odd would fill the interiors and
    turn each glyph into a blob.
