  <!--
    A ring with an exclamation, drawn on exactly the outer and inner radii its Info, Error and
    Success neighbours use, so the four semantic marks are one family at one weight. It was a hazard
    triangle: the road-sign shape for danger, which is a heavier thing to say than most of what this
    marks - a certificate without its private key, a resource not verified yet, a start type somebody
    deliberately chose. The bar and the dot are Info's, swapped top for bottom.
  -->
  <StreamGeometry x:Key="NutIconWarning">M12,2.6 A9.4,9.4 0 1 1 11.99,2.6 Z M12,4.3 A7.7,7.7 0 1 0 12.01,4.3 Z M11.1,6.4 L12.9,6.4 L12.9,13.6 L11.1,13.6 Z M11.1,15.4 L12.9,15.4 L12.9,17.4 L11.1,17.4 Z</StreamGeometry>
